  "number": 694,
  "state": "closed",
  "locked": false,
  "title": "Correct the value for Sv32x4 to 8",
  "user": {
    "login": "pkennedyTT",
    "id": 192360670,
    "node_id": "U_kgDOC3cw3g",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192360670?v=4",
    "gravatar_id": "",
    "url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/pkennedyTT",
    "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/followers",
    "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/following{/other_user}",
    "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/gists{/gist_id}",
    "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
    "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/subscriptions",
    "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/orgs",
    "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/repos",
    "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/events{/privacy}",
    "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/pkennedyTT/received_events",
    "type": "User",
    "user_view_type": "public",
    "site_admin": false
  },
  "body": "The privileged spec defines the hgatp mode Sv32x4 as 1. The MODE field of hgatp is 1 bit wide when HSXLEN=32 but 4 bits wide when HSXLEN=64.\r\n\r\nIn IOMMU, however, the MODE field of iohgatp is always 4 bits wide. As such, the value of Sv32x4 is defined as 8, which is what is obtained when zero-extending the value 1 three bits to the right. The interpretation of the MODE field is determined by fctl.GXL. When GXL is 0, a MODE of 8 indicates Sv39x4; when GXL is 1, it indicates Sv32x4.\r\n\r\nRelevant comment:\r\nhttps://github.com/riscv-non-isa/riscv-iommu/issues/77#issuecomment-1275084928",
  "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:13:58Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-11-30T16:40:16Z",
